      {
        "type": "Module",
        "name": "preamplifier",
        "description": "NE5532 dual op-amp used as single-channel preamplifier (first op-amp section: OUT1, IN1_N, IN1_P). Single 9V supply operation with VCC_P=9V, VCC_N=GND. Requires mid-supply DC bias reference (~4.5V) for single-supply AC amplification; this bias network is shared with power_amp module. Configured as non-inverting amplifier; gain set by external feedback resistor network to contribute to overall 100x-200x gain target. Input requires AC coupling capacitor from external audio source. Output requires AC coupling capacitor to LM386 input. Second op-amp section (OUT2, IN2_N, IN2_P) is unused and should have inputs tied to bias voltage to prevent oscillation.",
        "id": "preamplifier"
      },
