      {
        "type": "Module",
        "name": "power_amp",
        "description": "LM386 low-voltage audio power amplifier. Powered from 9V supply (VS pin to VIN_9V, GND pin to system GND). Input from NE5532 preamplifier output via AC coupling capacitor. Drives 8-ohm speaker at VOUT pin. Gain configured via GAIN_1 and GAIN_2 pins; default gain is 20, can be increased to 200 by adding capacitor between gain pins. BYPASS pin requires decoupling capacitor to GND for ripple rejection. Output may require coupling capacitor to speaker depending on DC bias configuration. Combined with preamplifier gain to achieve overall 100x-200x voltage gain.",
        "id": "power_amp"
